# Workers Static Assets redirects. The old theme published taxonomy pages.
# Categories are gone, so send them to the archive. Tags are back and served
# from /tags/ (a tag that no longer exists gets the 404 page, which links to
# /tags/), so they are not redirected.
/categories /posts/ 301
/categories/* /posts/ 301
/series /posts/ 301
/series/* /posts/ 301
/page/1/ / 301
/posts/page/1/ /posts/ 301
